cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use material, code, data, or methods from this repository, cite the
  repository and the specific commit, release, dataset, or source note you used.
title: Quantum Energy Venture Lab
type: software
authors:
  - name: Quantum Energy Venture Lab contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Svyable/quantum-energy
url: https://github.com/Svyable/quantum-energy
abstract: >-
  Open, evidence-first research and engineering repository for programmable
  open-quantum transport, environment-assisted excitation transport, organic
  photovoltaics, exciton and polariton systems, electron-phonon coupling,
  scientific metrology, manufacturing controls, and reproducible computation.
  The repository explicitly separates established evidence, assumptions,
  hypotheses, synthetic/model outputs, experiments, and invention concepts.
keywords:
  - open quantum systems
  - quantum transport
  - environment-assisted transport
  - exciton transport
  - polaritons
  - organic photovoltaics
  - electron-phonon coupling
  - metrology
  - reproducible research
  - open science
